// pfodWeb NOTE: excludes GPIO3/4/5/6/7/8/47/48 (dedicated onboard
// SX1262 LoRa radio SPI+control lines: LORA_MISO/SCK/MOSI/CS/ANT_SWITCH/
// DIO1/BUSY - see vendor pins_arduino.h). WisBlock IO1-6/A0/A1/CS slot
// pins and the general SDA1/SCL1/SS/MOSI/MISO/SCK bus are kept - the
// WisBlock module socket is optional/user-populated, not fixed hardware.
